  "description": "<h2>Game Description: Shadow's Embrace</h2><p>Step into the dark and mysterious world of <strong>Shadow's Embrace</strong>, an intense arena action game where you, a lone hero, must defend against relentless waves of monstrous creatures. Battle venomous spiders and airborne bats as they emerge in challenging phases, testing your combat prowess and strategic thinking. Unleash powerful combo attacks to clear each wave and prepare for the next, as the enemies grow stronger and more numerous with every victory. Can you stand your ground against the encroaching darkness and become the legend this world desperately needs?</p><p><br></p><h2>Controls Guide</h2><p>Mastering your hero's movements and attacks is key to survival in Shadow's Embrace.</p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Movement:</strong></li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-2\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong> Left Arrow Key:</strong> Move Left</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-2\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Right Arrow Key:</strong> Move Right</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-2\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Up Arrow Key:</strong> Jump</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Combat:</strong></li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-2\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Spacebar:</strong> Perform Attack. Repeated presses within a short window will unleash powerful <strong>attack combos!</strong></li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-2\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Shift Key (hold) + Left/Right Arrow Keys:</strong> Run</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-2\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Shift Key (hold) + Spacebar (while running):</strong> Execute a <strong>run attack</strong> for a swift offensive maneuver.</li></ol>",
  "instructions": "Instructions:1. Use UP arrow to jump & RIGHT arrow to throw 2. Use SPACE to call Shields",
